---
import img1 from "../../../../public/img/admin-ajax.webp";
import { User } from "lucide-astro";
import { AtSign } from "lucide-astro";
import { Clock8 } from "lucide-astro";
---

<section
  class="p-6 md:w-[100%] md:px-[250px] h-auto md:h-screen bg-[url('/img/landing-bg-2-white.webp')] bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat opacity-0 translate-y-4 animate-[fadeUp_0.6s_ease-out_forwards]"
>
  <div
    class="flex flex-col md:flex-row h-auto md:h-[55%] mt-[30px] gap-10 md:gap-0"
  >
    <div class="text-center md:text-left">
      <h1
        class="text-[40px] grid md:font-semiboldleading-tight md:leading-[90px]"
      >
        <span class="text-[60px]">Acervo Digital</span>
        <span class="text-[#b7d433] text-[60px]">Garantizado</span>
      </h1>

      <p
        class="w-full md:w-[72.5%] mt-[25px] text-[16px] leading-[25px] mx-auto md:mx-0"
      >
        En Indexa Digital, ofrecemos un servicio integral de digitalización de
        documentos para transformar sus archivos físicos en un valioso acervo
        digital.
      </p>

      <p
        class="w-full md:w-[72.5%] mt-[25px] text-[16px] leading-[25px] mx-auto md:mx-0"
      >
        <strong>
          Llene el formulario a continuación con todos sus datos para iniciar
          con el proceso de digitalización hoy mismo:
        </strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-[20px] place-items-center md:place-items-end">
      <div class="grid w-[150px] text-center">
        <a
          class="bg-[#b7d433] px-[10px] py-[5px] border-l border-l-[rgba(254,254,254,0.3)] text-[0.7rem] rounded-[25px] text-white hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition"
          href="https://indexa.mx/"
        >
          INDEXA.MX
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid w-[150px] text-center">
        <p
          class="bg-[#b7d433] px-[10px] py-[5px] border-l border-l-[rgba(254,254,254,0.3)] text-[0.7rem] uppercase rounded-[25px] text-white hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition cursor-pointer"
        >
          Digitalización
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="relative flex justify-center">
        <div
          class="w-[75%] rounded-[100%] md:w-[100%] h-[105%] absolute bg-[#b7d433]"
        >
        </div>
        <img
          src={img1.src}
          class="w-[70%] md:w-full rounded-full animate-[float_3s_ease-in-out_infinite]"
        />
      </div>

      <button
        class="bg-[#0f143a] px-[10px] py-[5px] text-[0.7rem] uppercase rounded-[25px] text-white w-[150px] hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition"
      >
        Más Información
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div
    class="w-full md:w-[47%] flex flex-col justify-center lg:mt-[10px] inline-table md:mt-[60px] inline-table"
  >
    <div
      class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mb-[30px] mt-[30px]"
    >
      <div class="flex">
        <label
          class="bg-[#0f143a] text-white px-[15px] py-[7px] rounded-l-full"
        >
          <User />
        </label>
        <input
          class="border rounded-r-[20px] w-full bg-white md:w-[200px]"
          placeholder="Nombre completo..."
        />
      </div>

      <div class="flex">
        <label
          class="bg-[#0f143a] text-white px-[15px] py-[7px] rounded-l-full"
        >
          <AtSign />
        </label>
        <input
          type="email"
          class="border rounded-r-[20px] w-full bg-white md:w-[200px]"
          placeholder="Correo electrónico..."
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-center mb-[10px] text-[16px]">
      ¿En qué horario podemos contactarle?
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
      <div class="flex">
        <label
          class="bg-[#0f143a] text-white px-[15px] py-[7px] rounded-l-full"
        >
          <Clock8 />
        </label>
        <select class="border rounded-r-[20px] w-full bg-white md:w-[200px]">
          <option>- Hora inicial -</option>
          <option value="09:00">09:00 AM</option>
          <option value="10:00">10:00 AM</option>
          <option value="11:00">11:00 AM</option>
          <option value="12:00">12:00 PM</option>
          <option value="13:00">13:00 PM</option>
          <option value="14:00">14:00 PM</option>
          <option value="15:00">15:00 PM</option>
          <option value="16:00">16:00 PM</option>
          <option value="17:00">17:00 PM</option>
          <option value="18:00">18:00 PM</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div class="flex">
        <label
          class="bg-[#0f143a] text-white px-[15px] py-[7px] rounded-l-full"
        >
          <Clock8 />
        </label>
        <select class="border rounded-r-[20px] w-full bg-white md:w-[200px]">
          <option>- Hora final -</option>
          <option value="09:00">09:00 AM</option>
          <option value="10:00">10:00 AM</option>
          <option value="11:00">11:00 AM</option>
          <option value="12:00">12:00 PM</option>
          <option value="13:00">13:00 PM</option>
          <option value="14:00">14:00 PM</option>
          <option value="15:00">15:00 PM</option>
          <option value="16:00">16:00 PM</option>
          <option value="17:00">17:00 PM</option>
          <option value="18:00">18:00 PM</option>
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>

    <button
      class="bg-[#0f143a] text-white rounded-[25px] mt-[20px] w-full md:w-[50%] md:h-[39%] mx-auto block hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition"
    >
      ENVIAR SOLICITUD
    </button>
  </div>
</section>
